Scales: [keys=keys().slice(0, 1)]
-=- scale-mode
Scales3: [key]:freeze [modeName(mode)]:freeze [ss(`dia chrom arp hm mm +1 -1 +6 lyddom`)] [shiftsDistributed(mode.shifts, \[1, -2, -3, 4\], '0112223333')]:freeze:show-2 [shiftsDistributed(22, \[1, 2, 3, 3, -4\], '0112223333')]:freeze:show-1
-=- Scales::
{shuffle(keys.flatMap(k => { key = k; return modeShifts(key).flatMap((_, m) => { mode = m; return blockLines('scale-mode') \}) \}))}
